NAME
       cmp - compare two files byte by byte

SYNOPSIS
       cmp [-l | -s] [-b] [-n LIMIT] [-i SKIP1[:SKIP2]] file1
          [file2 [skip1 [skip2]]]

DESCRIPTION
       Exit status: 0 the same, 1 different, 2 trouble.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

